## Project structure

```text
app/
  page.tsx                 Login
  dashboard/               Patient monitoring table
  alerts/                  Alert triage
  patients/[id]/           Patient detail
  patient-view/            Simplified patient view
  layout.tsx, globals.css  Shared layout and styles
components/
  Shell.tsx, Sidebar.tsx   App layout and navigation
  VitalCard.tsx            Vital sign tiles
  TrendChart.tsx           Simulated trend chart
  DeteriorationPanel.tsx   Compares readings against a simulated baseline
  ClinicalActions.tsx      Acknowledge alert and add clinical notes
lib/
  data.ts                  Simulated patients and alerts
```

## Limitations

- All patient and sensor readings are simulated and hard coded. No real patient data is used or collected.
- The trend charts are static illustrations and are not driven by the patient data.
- Alert acknowledgements and clinical notes are held in the browser only and reset when the page reloads.
- The concept supports clinical awareness and does not replace professional judgement.

